Recommends: lxqt-policykit
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Homepage: https://edukasaunos.tl
Description: parental and school web protection for Edukasaun OS
 Eduka-Block is a lightweight GTK application for parents and teachers.
 It blocks websites, domains, IP addresses and ranges for every user and
 browser through wildcard DNS, a managed /etc/hosts section and nftables.
 One click enables category lists (adult content, gambling, malware, social
 media), SafeSearch, and protection against encrypted-DNS bypass with
 browser policies. An optional Squid proxy blocks URL keywords. The
 interface includes English, Tetum, European and Brazilian Portuguese, and
 Indonesian.
